<title>POLAND: Olawa Q2 net rises to PLN 1.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Olawa Q2 net rises to PLN 1.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olawa preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     1.57   vs    0.98</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 1.81   vs    1.22</p>
<p>    net profit			     1.12   vs    0.71</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Huta Olawa SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     14.07   vs   11.96</p>
<p>    costs of sales			10.89   vs    2.49</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.70   vs    0.51</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.01   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.23   vs    0.29</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.00   vs    0.04</p>
<p>    investment			     0.26   vs    0.65</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     2.94   vs    2.38</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 3.48   vs    2.83</p>
<p>    net profit			     2.12   vs    1.65</p>
<p>    net sales			     27.82   vs   23.16</p>
<p>    costs of sales			22.14   vs   19.04</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.02   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.35   vs    1.17</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.01   vs    0.02</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   2.55   vs    0.52</p>
<p>    financial costs			2.03   vs    0.07</p>
<p>    investment			     0.64   vs    2.17</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
